# VHS tape — regenerate with: vhs assets/demo.tape
Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1150
Set Height 620
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set WaitTimeout 120s

# warm-up (hidden): make sure the shell and fixen are ready
Hide
Type "fixen --version"
Enter
Wait
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type `fixen "I has a apple and she go to school yesterday"`
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Wait
Sleep 2s

Type `fixen -e -l Korean "he dont know nothing about it"`
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Wait
Sleep 3s

Type `fixen -t Japanese "私は昨日学校に行きたです"`
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Wait
Sleep 4s
